The SYCL kernels are ports of the TernOCL OpenCL kernels
(https://github.com/libxsmm/TernOCL), which port Intel XeTLA kernels
(int2_fp16_upcvt_xmx_xe.hpp, int2_fp16_dpas_xmx_xe.hpp,
int2_bf16_dpas_xmx_xe.hpp) and follow their data layouts, dequantization and
quantization schemes.
